title: JVM: the Truffle code engine, phases 1-4
branch: pr/04-truffle-code-engine

# nqp sections N6 (code engine phases 1-2, 12 commits) + N7 (phases 3-4,
# 15 commits): log lines 206..232, 27 commits.

= JVM: runtime and build fixes ahead of the code engine
The null singleton and rx STATES no longer pin finished runs; putfield pops
two and putstatic pops one in the autosplit method writer; the bind_error
handler stands in for the failed call; the gradle runners give the compiler
a 64MB stack.
# moved: f9515a2e7 (buildSrc GenerateRunnerTask.kt only) pulled ahead of
# f1ba81f7e (Rx*.kt, RxDescriptor.nqp), b8df13a24 (Qt*.java,
# nqp-truffle/build.gradle.kts) and f0d04b155 (NqpSources.kt, Compiler.nqp,
# QtEncoder.nqp, qast_sources) -- disjoint files.
- 4f65249a8 JVM: stop the null singleton and rx STATES from pinning finished runs
- 047623f28 JVM: putfield pops two, putstatic pops one
- 79a23a628 JVM: let the bind_error handler stand in for the failed call
- f9515a2e7 Gradle runners: give the compiler a 64MB stack

= Truffle engine: backreferences, backtracking loop marks, bol/eol, \s
Working backreferences and loop marks that backtrack; LOOP_SPLIT no longer
shares its opcode with POS_EQ_REG (every conj broke); bol/eol refuse the
post-trailing-newline position and \s is nqp's.
# moved: d1a6573d4 (RxProgram.kt, RxVmNode.kt) pulled ahead of b8df13a24 and
# f0d04b155; 9d5dafb36 (RxVmNode.kt) pulled ahead of b8df13a24 .. 8382da1c1.
# Every commit jumped touches only Qt*/Nqp*.java, nqp-truffle/build.gradle.kts,
# buildSrc, Compiler.nqp, QtEncoder/TruffleEncoder.nqp, qast_sources,
# CodeEngine.kt, DispatchBootstrap.kt -- no Rx* file among them.
- f1ba81f7e Truffle engine: working backreferences, and loop marks that backtrack
- d1a6573d4 Truffle engine: LOOP_SPLIT collided with POS_EQ_REG; every conj broke
- 9d5dafb36 Rx engine: bol/eol refuse the post-trailing-newline position; \s is nqp's

