= Truffle migration Phase 2: blocks run on the engine over the nqpp wire
The code engine's wire road: NqpProgramBuilder, NqpWire, NqpOps and
NqpCodeEngine behind CodeEngine.kt, proven live before any block used it.
Local types travel in the nqpp header and engine locals start zeroed.
TruffleEncoder encodes whole blocks, and the nqp suite proves them.
- cccda0b6b Truffle migration Phase 2: the code engine, wire road proven
- f7f1862f9 nqpp wire: local types in the header; engine locals start zeroed
- 343151a29 Truffle migration Phase 2: blocks run on the engine, nqp suite proving

= Code engine: the Raku mainline runs; params, want() and void reads
Args and results carry types; param tasks run, and positionals go before
nameds; resultchild and void reads are semantics, not style; the encoder
mirrors the want() selector, and 'v' hides BEGIN-parked code.
- 3db74ba80 Code engine: the Raku mainline runs; args and results carry types
- 477fbfaf6 Code engine: param tasks run, and positionals go before nameds
- d8317c3ea Code engine: resultchild and void reads, both semantics not style
- 8382da1c1 Code engine: mirror the want() selector; 'v' hides BEGIN-parked code

