= Phase 4: precompiled units encode; programs travel as a jar sidecar
Precompiled units encode behind NQP_CODE_PRECOMP; object-typed value slots
are coerced and qbid slots shift past a coercion splice; a compilation
unit's engine programs ride in a jar sidecar, referenced by index.
- 2b47462b3 Phase 4, first tranche: precompiled units encode behind NQP_CODE_PRECOMP
- 4571743fb Code engine: coerce object-typed value slots; shift qbid slots past a coercion splice
- 4927f37be Phase 4: engine programs travel as a jar sidecar, referenced by index

= Phase 4: engine dispatch sites get inline caches; virtual threads
Descriptor tables resolve per class; a resumed program's frame gets the
resuming thread's tc; nqp threads are virtual by default. Two debug knobs
from the Phase 4 hunt ride along: NQP_DISPATCH_OLDDESC and NQP_CODE_UNCACHED.
# spans: 7f7a680ca introduces NQP_DISPATCH_OLDDESC / NQP_CODE_UNCACHED; their
# removal lives in a later section (N10), so the introduction stays in place.
- 172cd1eba Phase 4: engine dispatch sites get inline caches; descriptor tables resolve per class
- d0f052cf3 Code engine: a resumed program's frame gets the resuming thread's tc
- f665c74a1 JVM threads: nqp threads are virtual by default
- 7f7a680ca Debug knobs from the Phase 4 hunt: NQP_DISPATCH_OLDDESC, NQP_CODE_UNCACHED
